  <item>
    <title>11 关于性感音乐，我们想聊的一切</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b9380797178f08ee39d196</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b9380797178f08ee39d196</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Sep 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有史以来从录制到发布最快的一期内容，我们畅谈了「性感音乐」的内核和边界，并通过四首歌曲分享勾勒出各自心中的暧昧氛围。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎听完的大家交出你私藏的性感歌曲！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 录音小插曲，太报意思了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> 反向定义！性感音乐不是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 夜幕降临，在酒吧相拥起舞的两人：Sade - Smooth Operator</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> 都市丛林里的的“莫式情歌”：莫文蔚 - 《十二楼》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 西语呢喃的性感：The Marías - Un Millón</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> 很坏的808：Normani - Wild Side ft. Cardi B</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:9</a>5 低频=性感，从何说起？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3001">50:01</a> 聊聊MV！从D’Angelo的大嘴唇说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3478">57:58</a> 小甜甜Britney Spears：性感偶像还是符号囚徒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3769">62:49</a> 不是人写的就不性感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【指路链接】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>MV “The Marías - Un Millón”: </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cQZDH4NWmaU&amp;list=RDcQZDH4NWmaU&amp;start_radio=1" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cQZDH4NWmaU&amp;list=RDcQZDH4NWmaU&amp;start_radio=1"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>MV “D’Angelo - Untitled (How Does It Feel)”: </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SxVNOnPyvIU&amp;list=RDSxVNOnPyvIU&amp;start_radio=1" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SxVNOnPyvIU&amp;list=RDSxVNOnPyvIU&amp;start_radio=1"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>播客《过刊045：迪士尼女孩长大后》: </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62e298c264f141ad81501e24" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62e298c264f141ad81501e24"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【节目介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「SouLoud 搜唠」是一档由两位00后音乐制作人好朋友带来的电台节目，每两周更新一期轻松好玩的音乐闲谈、歌单分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的内容，欢迎订阅、转发、留言，Let’s 唠！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjK5XN_6a2WmV5Q0aksRpMSNmKJr.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
