  <item>
    <title>09 关于我们在朝阳公园办DJ Party这件事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66aa17df33ddcbb53c63ced7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66aa17df33ddcbb53c63ced7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Aug 2024 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>演完唠两句！7月20日，SouLoud 在北京朝阳公园的大草坪上放了一场 Hiphop &amp; House DJ Set，和一群可爱的人留下了非常「火热」的音乐记忆。第九期，两位新晋DJ为大家共同回溯一下这场派对的全过程，收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> </span></strong><span>想死你们了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 把派对从新疆开到北京</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 户外DJ的高温挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a> 忘记录音？放错Channel？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 一场和大家合力完成的演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a> 主播Jin的今日推荐：Every Little Step - Bobby Brown</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> 什么是最好的跳舞音乐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> SouLoud又一个美好瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 演完就互删？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 印象最深刻的观众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 吐槽时间！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【节目介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「SouLoud 搜唠」是SouLoud音乐旗下的电台节目，每周由两位00后唱作人、DJ为大家带来一期户外歌单分享、音乐杂谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为音乐，更爱生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入我们的社群！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkC3ZEjsPxSnMnJsLaBkbZkMpiri.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
