  <item>
    <title>07 新疆旅行回来，对未来十年有了期待</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66882e3bae8e21859ad6b293</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66882e3bae8e21859ad6b293</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jul 2024 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>intj和enfp的创业+团建之旅，会发生怎样的化学反应？SouLoud第7期，我们激情回顾了本电台诞生的重大时刻，一路的成长，以及六月新疆特别节目背后，我俩克服九九八十一难的精彩故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> SouLoud音乐的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a> “遇到问题 解决问题”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 48小时内出发的新疆团建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 如何测试两人适不适合一起播客/旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 能用的家当都带上了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 盘山公路上一场没有硝烟的战争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 做户外音乐，任重道远！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 主播Yucci的今日推荐：whelmed - emawk</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 新疆治好了我们的完美主义和j人焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">35:18</a> 馕、瓜子、奶啤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> 酸酸酸马奶初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> 火车站前的惊魂一刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">41:07</a> 回程路上开始规划厂牌未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">44:03</a> 夸夸time！从第一期到现在的成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">49:27</a> 浅上了一周的班，给辞了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【节目介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「SouLoud 搜唠」是一档由两位00后音乐制作人好朋友带来的创意生活类播客，每周更新一期轻松好玩的音乐闲谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的内容，欢迎订阅、转发、留言，Let’s 唠！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvLm7QWWy2EB5wOma7pOazku5uG-.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhzmoFpNTgTN0a1Dt5rpXvSCzGZu.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
