  <item>
    <title>04 拿什么拯救你，我的华语流行乐坛！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666d55a5b6a8412729ed48c3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666d55a5b6a8412729ed48c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Jun 2024 08:49:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“中国音乐为什么土？”这是我们在录制之前激情写下的问题，本以为是一场彻头彻尾的吐槽大会，结果还真被我们聊出一些解决办法！这里是SouLoud第4期，你将听到华语歌曲要走向世界，得从小学音乐课抓起、从meme抓起、从非牛顿流体抓起、从爱豆粉丝抓起......请听我们解释......</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 蹭个大的，聊聊《歌手》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 国外比风格，国内比唱功？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 是谁觉得混音不重要？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> “钢琴是钢琴，鼓是鼓，贝斯是吉他”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a> 那些年上过的小学音乐课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 不应该是英子，但我们只有英子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a> 什么音乐能代表现在的中国？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 规则是可以被打破的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> 隔壁的City Pop和K-pop</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> 主播Jin的今日推荐：讨厌 - 芮恩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 火到外网的egg man和雪花飘飘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 理想主义和”囚徒困境“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1934">32:14</a> 听众和创作者的双向奔赴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">37:09</a> 想了解音乐真的很容易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2546">42:26</a> “我考考你，什么是是爵士？“（不建议男听众使用）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a> idol粉丝是真·乐评人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【节目介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「SouLoud 搜唠」是一档由两位00后音乐制作人好朋友带来的创意生活类播客，每周更新一期轻松好玩的音乐闲谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的内容，欢迎订阅、转发、留言，Let’s 唠！</span></p>]]></description>
