  <item>
    <title>03 当音乐人谈论运动时，ta在谈论什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6656acdc06bc73decb2397b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6656acdc06bc73decb2397b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 May 2024 04:19:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>00后音乐人都爱哪些运动？运动又是怎样帮助我们创作的？SouLoud第3期，我们从高尔夫、篮球、剑玉一路侃到电子竞技、健身、越野跑，希望听完的你也能浑身是劲儿，活力满满！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 历史性时刻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 录节目前挥两杆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 我俩从排练室“打”到篮球场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">03:22</a> 欢迎本期嘉宾：乐儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a> 超小众！剑玉是一项什么运动？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 剑玉和音乐的联系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 独特的beatbox技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 电子竞技运动，俗称打游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a> 到底是谁在给游戏编曲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 学了配乐还能愉快地打游戏吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> 原神、超级马里奥、NBA2K原声带</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 篮球现场的DJ和键盘手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">25:21</a> 主播Yucci的今日推荐：FAMJAM4000 - Jordan Ward</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 对音乐迷茫就去健身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> 金金的21公里越野赛体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> “如果我能跑下来，我音乐就能行”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 体育比音乐的进步更容易看到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1997">33:17</a> 斯坦福大学研究：运动时更有创造力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> 音乐人的偶像包袱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【节目介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「SouLoud 搜唠」是一档由两位00后音乐制作人好朋友带来的创意生活类播客，每周更新一期轻松好玩的音乐闲谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的内容，欢迎订阅、转发、留言，Let’s 唠</span><strong><span>！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj5Pu0zYXxM7IakkT-W9m3Y0jq5U.m4a" length="69776051" type="audio/mp4"/>
